DESCRIPTION:Pendant Workshop\n\n  \n    \n      \n        \n          $175
 .00\n        \n      \n    \n  \n\nFriday\, November 20th 10:00am-2:00pm I
 n this class\, students will learn the art of weaving in a circular patter
 n to create beautiful round pendants. Students will use raffia or a large 
 assortment of strings to create these woven spirals. You will learn how to
  add columns\, change colors\, and finish your project in this 4 hour work
 shop. All materials will be provided. These spirals can be utilized as a w
 all piece\, or worn as a pendant! About the Teacher: Carrie Botto is a sel
 f taught multi medium weaver. She started weaving with beads over 40 years
  ago and continues to add skills and techniques to her “tool box”. Car
 rie travels all over the country now teach several different classes\, and
  has taught at Mendocino Art Center\, New Mexico Bead Trader\, Moab Art Ce
 nter\, and Fiber on 4th in New Mexico. Follow Carrie on Instagram @beanstr
 eetstudio!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n
