 0:00am-3:00pm $125.00 + $20.00 Materials fee In this class\, students will
  be creating decorative stones\, utilizing wrapping techniques that can be
  applied outside of this class. Students will learn 3 basic knots with tim
 e allotted between each lesson for students to experiment creating new sto
 nes with the new knot. This approach allows everyone’s imagination to ru
 n wild\, fostering creativity and allowing time for new ideas. All materia
 ls provided. Students often make 6-8 stones per class. There will be discu
 ssion breaks\, and a lunch break throughout the class. Please bring water 
 and a paper bag lunch. About the Teacher: Carrie Botto is a self taught mu
 lti-medium weaver. She started weaving with beads over 40 years ago and co
 ntinues to add skills and techniques to her “tool box”. Carrie travels
